      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After the rescue of Queen Angella, Adora has picked up a ratherâ€¦ interesting new hobby. And now, sheâ€™s finally ready to share it with Catra. (Catradora, Canon, Fluff)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
